### 先建立工作台会话，替换占位值；无真实凭证。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:17892
@csrf = replace-workbench-csrf
@cookie = replace-workbench-cookie
@task = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 启动后台同步；HTTP 202
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/wishes/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"role":{"game_uid":"500000001","region":"cn_qd01","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"}}

### 查询进度（取消时将路径改为 /sync/cancel）
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/wishes/sync/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"role":{"game_uid":"500000001","region":"cn_qd01","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"},"task_id":"{{task}}"}

### 已保存统计（导出时将路径改为 /export）
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/wishes/summary
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"game_uid":"500000001","region":"cn_qd01","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"}

### 明细；下一页 before_id 使用 next_id
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/wishes/records
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"role":{"game_uid":"500000001","region":"cn_qd01","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"},"pool":"301","limit":50}

### 导入示例（空文件不增加抽数）
POST {{base}}/api/workbench/genshin/wishes/import
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ng_workbench={{cookie}}
X-Workspace-CSRF: {{csrf}}

{"role":{"game_uid":"500000001","region":"cn_qd01","game_biz":"hk4e_cn"},"document":{"info":{"version":"v4.2"},"hk4e":[{"uid":"500000001","timezone":8,"list":[]}]}}
